DATA = "ance tests\nUnit tests: accept ordinary sandbox ZIP/wheel/sdist links; ignore unrelated URLs; reject traversal, percent encodings, host confusion, excessive links and duplicate URLs; local directory traversal cannot escape artifact root; collision handling does not overwrite existing files. Mock fetch + CDP cookies for successful bytes, non-200 statuses, redirect rejection, overflow, missing cookies, partial cleanup. Run `candidate_gate.py`, typecheck and focused tests when dependencies available. Logged-in live ChatGPT download remains target-runtime verification; do not claim it passed offline.\n\n## Adversarial design critique and revisions (pre-code)\n1. Preliminary design might reuse the generated-image `redirect: follow`; a malicious response redirect could leak cookies. **Revision:** forbid redirects and require fixed network origin.\n2. Naive `path.basename` filename selection plus `writeFile` overwrites a pre-existing session artifact and symlink target. **Revision:** exclusive `wx` creation, safe filename, no reliance on a check-then-write path existence check.\n3. `arrayBuffer()` on an assistant-controlled large response can exhaust memory. **Revision:** byte-limited streaming and timeout, delete partial output on error.\n4. Assistant could embed hundreds of links in repeated turns causing uncontrolled work. **Revision:** bounded unique links and bounded per-file content.\n\n## Freeze\nThis prompt is frozen before any source changes; any implementation deviations and unverified assumptions belong in the receipt, not retroactive edits to this prompt.\n"
